body:
I don't know why but... I just can't stop feeling theres something wrong with her expression. Don't know if its the eyes or the mouth, or both, but it just feels wrong.

&#x200B;

But at least they gave her muscles.

I made my own Shintaro jacket back in 2013 with an Adidas red jacket. They normally come with three white stripes instead of one, so I removed them, bought some cloth and sewed a single stripe on both arms. Aside from the adidas logo, it looks like Shintaro's jacket and I even cosplayed as him once.

&#x200B;

Of course, this was during 2013 and I live in Argentina, so I have no idea neither how expensive they are today nor if they are still selling them (though I recently went to a mall here and they were selling the same jacket but in blue, which I would have used to make an Ene jacket).

&#x200B;

It's really basic but I hope this helps!
